+    text: "# Readio -> audioexport: compatibility-first extraction
+
+
+      **Reference inputs**: uploaded Readio Codecrate snapshot (2026-10-08) and `02_readio_modular_migration_roadmap.md`,
+      milestone 06. This is an **implementation guide**, not an applied Readio patch."
+    links: []
